WEBVTT

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:03.601
I was met with a tone that was unlike
anything I had ever heard from my mother.

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:05.059
My mother's loud.

00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:09.351
But she spoke in a hush,
still, muffled tone

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:11.851
that conveyed a sense of sadness.

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:14.309
And as she whispered, she said, "Michael,

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:17.559
your cousin Donnell
was murdered last night,

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:18.851
on Halloween,

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:21.226
at a house party in Stockton."

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.684
And like far too many people
in this country,

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.643
particularly from communities like mine,

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.351
particularly that look like me,

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:32.393
I spent the better part of the year
dealing with anger, rage, nihilism,